"""
Benchmark harness for MuseTalk inference pipeline.
Measures per-phase timing using CUDA events and establishes the noise floor.

Usage (from repo root, with .venv activated):
    PYTHONPATH=musetalk/utils:$PYTHONPATH python scripts/benchmark.py --mode baseline
    PYTHONPATH=musetalk/utils:$PYTHONPATH python scripts/benchmark.py --mode noise_floor
    PYTHONPATH=musetalk/utils:$PYTHONPATH python scripts/benchmark.py --mode batch_scaling
"""

